<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: SOCCER-IRELAND BEAT MACEDONIA 4-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-IRELAND BEAT MACEDONIA 4-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland beat Macedonia 4-0</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their European under-21 soccer championship</p>
<p>group eight qualifier on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Foley (32nd min), Carr (72nd), Kennedy (86th, 88th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 2,300</p>
</text>
